<title>USA: Criticare, Advanced Medical in pact.</title>
<headline>Criticare, Advanced Medical in pact.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Criticare Systems Inc, a developer of medical monitoring equipment, said it and Advanced Medical Inc signed an exclusive supply and distribution agreement for sales of select vital signs monitoring products in the U.S. hospital market and in Canada.</p>
<p>Advanced Medical currently is a partner with Criticare in development of several products that combine the company's electronic thermometer technology into several key Criticare patient monitoring systems.</p>
<p>The latest supply and distribution agreement initiates the next step in bringing these new products to market.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
